OL,3,ACity plan change sought to protect
OL,4,ATower of London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Tower of London is "at risk" of
OL,7,Fbeing added to UNESCO's list of World
OL,8,FHeritage in Danger sites unless
OL,9,Famendments are made to the City of
OL,10,FLondon Corporation's draft local plan,
OL,11,Fexperts have said.
OL,13,FHistoric England, a government advisory
OL,14,Fbody, said there was "serious concern"
OL,15,Fabout the famous citadel due to the
OL,16,Fsize of potential future skyscrapers in
OL,17,Fthe east of the Square Mile.
OL,19,FIt is seeking changes to the
OL,20,FCorporation's draft City Plan 2040 over
OL,21,Fwhere new developments may be permitted
OL,22,Fnear the Tower.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
