OL,3,ACity plan change sought to protect
OL,4,ATower of London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Corporation has said the suggestion
OL,7,Ffrom Historic England would affect
OL,8,Feconomic growth and make little
OL,9,Fdifference to heritage protection.
